async function fileBase64(file,max){if(!file||!file.size)throw Error('请选择文件');if(file.size>max*1024*1024)throw Error('文件不能超过'+max+'MB');return new Promise((yes,no)=>{const r=new FileReader();r.onload=()=>yes(r.result.split(',')[1]);r.onerror=no;r.readAsDataURL(file);});}
function openDelete(id){if(state?.user.role!=='ADMIN')return;const s=state.shipments.find(s=>s.id===id);if(!s)return;deleting=id;$('#deleteForm').reset();$('#deleteDescription').textContent='将删除：'+s.product+' · '+s.number;$('#deleteDialog').showModal();}
$('#deleteForm').onsubmit=async e=>{e.preventDefault();const button=e.target.querySelector('.danger');button.disabled=true;try{await api('/api/shipments/'+deleting+'/delete',Object.fromEntries(new FormData(e.target)));$('#deleteDialog').close();if(location.hash==='#shipment/'+deleting)location.hash='';await refresh();toast('运单已移入回收站');}catch(err){toast(err.message);}finally{button.disabled=false;}};
async function showTrash(){try{const b=await api('/api/trash');$('#trashList').innerHTML=b.shipments.length?b.shipments.map(s=>`<article class="notice"><h3>${esc(s.product)}</h3><p>${esc(s.number)} · 删除于 ${fmt(s.deleted_at)}</p><button class="ghost" data-restore="${s.id}">恢复运单</button></article>`).join(''):'<p class="empty">回收站为空</p>';document.querySelectorAll('[data-restore]').forEach(button=>button.onclick=async()=>{button.disabled=true;try{await api('/api/shipments/'+button.dataset.restore+'/restore',{});await refresh();await showTrash();toast('运单已恢复');}catch(err){toast(err.message);}finally{button.disabled=false;}});if(!$('#trashDialog').open)$('#trashDialog').showModal();}catch(err){toast(err.message);}}
$('#navTrash').onclick=showTrash;

document.addEventListener('change',async e=>{const input=e.target.closest('[data-payment]');if(!input)return;const checked=input.checked,id=input.dataset.payment;document.querySelectorAll('[data-payment="'+id+'"]').forEach(el=>el.disabled=true);try{await api('/api/shipments/'+id+'/payment',{payment_status:checked?'paid':'unpaid'});await refresh();if(!$('#shipmentDetailPage').hidden&&selected===id)showDetail(id);toast(checked?'已切换为已付':'已切换为未付');}catch(err){input.checked=!checked;toast(err.message);}finally{document.querySelectorAll('[data-payment="'+id+'"]').forEach(el=>el.disabled=false);}});

